"setting": "Scarpewick Tailings SW-4 (invented), dam crest C-3. Hardware-in-the-loop spare corner-cube in Corner-HIL-2 supplies the wrapped-phase waveform that times the in-service keep-pool stop. Plant-owned Ku-band ground-based InSAR. Slopeveil vendor piezometer-inverted LOS is the only OEM slope SoT. Not DAS phi-OTDR (r4), not BOTDA (r14), not FBG glaze (r13), not geodetic MEMS (r02), not fluxgate (r5).",